&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a trusted thought partner to People/HR, FP&amp;amp;A, Accounting, and legal teams to align payroll execution with broader corporate strategies and company goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We would love to consider you for this role if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
