&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IP Fabric&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join a pioneering force in network automation! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW160894911 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160894911 BCX0&quot;&gt;At IP Fabric, we enable people to uncover the truth about their networks. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW160894911 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160894911 BCX0&quot;&gt;Built by network professionals and industry experts, our innovative solutions are transforming how enterprises manage their networks. As a post-Series B company, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160894911 BCX0&quot;&gt;we&#39;re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW160894911 BCX0&quot;&gt; expanding rapidly across Europe, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW160894911 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;div_block-83-14832&quot; class=&quot;ct-div-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;text_block-85-14832&quot; class=&quot;ct-text-block font-style&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;div_block-167-14832&quot; class=&quot;ct-div-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;17&quot; data-local-id=&quot;acf3273d-9c2e-4889-8057-5bd2f44ec6ca&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Senior Platform Engineer (L3/L4)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Platform Team and help evolve the core architecture of IP Fabric’s product. You will work hands‑on in the codebase, drive architectural improvements, and enable other engineering teams through a stronger, more scalable platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;313&quot; data-local-id=&quot;950d2bbc-73ee-4556-bf80-525ab1e6153b&quot;&gt;This is a high‑impact &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;IC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; role requiring strong backend engineering skills, architectural thinking, and the ability to collaborate closely with Product and other engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ct-div-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW179799343 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW179799343 BCX0&quot;&gt;What &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW179799343 BCX0&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW179799343 BCX0&quot;&gt; Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW179799343 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;506&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1c6625f9-49c1-4150-9bb3-dae0aede1515&quot;&gt;Design, refactor, and evolve core platform components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;563&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fbd1426a-e19e-45ab-af01-beecef847fa6&quot;&gt;Drive architectural improvements to reduce technical debt and improve scalability and stability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot; data-local-id=&quot;47904f03-8e95-4682-85f5-29d91beb45cd&quot;&gt;Own platform initiatives from problem definition to delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;726&quot; data-local-id=&quot;628f78b1-cf9c-4cae-b009-06266897ddd5&quot;&gt;Improve build, deployment, and operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;782&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ffe1a63e-7e34-40b3-ae6d-ba1043a01a53&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with Product to translate business goals into technical roadmap items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;875&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e6b2e28e-6a70-4a3c-8273-cd5457176377&quot;&gt;Mentor and support other engineers through technical leadership and clear communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW106521436 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW106521436 BCX0&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;993&quot; data-local-id=&quot;58f3361a-5562-4477-b890-e69943e77483&quot;&gt;Strong backend engineering experience with TypeScript / Node.js&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1060&quot; data-local-id=&quot;10380070-ebf0-4f97-a88c-a798363d6e54&quot;&gt;Experience working with PostgreSQL and Redis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1108&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6e56cfc0-9fff-4941-959c-405844af19f1&quot;&gt;Proven experience refactoring and maintaining existing production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1185&quot; data-local-id=&quot;18302be9-31cf-46a8-973a-e5143e46a5b1&quot;&gt;Experience with on‑prem and cloud deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1234&quot; data-local-id=&quot;437969ef-8981-47d5-a13f-a3c0ccf130b4&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently and identify what needs to be done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1302&quot; data-local-id=&quot;912fab8e-e2bd-4b49-afcc-ef6b7a0695a9&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid VISA to work in Czechia / EU&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points If You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1391&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3cb4f58c-e797-4b44-a20b-8137669afbaf&quot;&gt;Experience in platform or enablement teams&lt;/li&gt;
