&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to maintain or obtain Government Security Clearance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What We’d Love:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with scripting in Python or MATLAB for automation of FEM workflows and post-processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience supporting vibration, acoustic, or shock testing, including fixture design and instrumentation planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for the commercial and government space industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for spacecraft or launch vehicle system development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
